  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00126362_DepartmentOfEnergyOfCounterpartiesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 STARPLUS의 Department of Energy 차입금과 관련하여 STARPLUS 출자금 1,113,603백만원을 담보로 제공하고 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00126362_SeoulGuaranteeInsuranceCoLtdOfCounterpartiesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 법원 공탁, 각종 인허가 및 계약이행보증 등과 관련하여 서울보증보험(주)으로부터 13,888백만원의 보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
